WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.136
Cat wanted to sleep.

2
00:00:23.137 --> 00:00:27.790
She climbed onto the hay.

3
00:00:27.791 --> 00:00:31.498
Cat stretched.

4
00:00:31.499 --> 00:00:35.463
She curled up.

5
00:00:35.464 --> 00:00:41.809
Cow came into the barn.

6
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:45.620
"Time to hula hoop," said Cow.

7
00:00:45.621 --> 00:00:51.763
"One, two, three. One, two, three."

8
00:00:51.764 --> 00:00:58.711
"I can't sleep here," thought Cat.

9
00:00:58.712 --> 00:01:04.750
"Cow is hooping."

10
00:01:04.751 --> 00:01:32.814
Cat went to the pond.

11
00:01:32.815 --> 00:01:39.503
"Quack! Quack!" said the ducks.

12
00:01:39.504 --> 00:01:44.208
"I can't sleep here," said Cat.

13
00:01:44.209 --> 00:01:49.162
"The ducks are quacking."

14
00:01:49.163 --> 00:02:07.480
Cat went to the tractor.

15
00:02:07.481 --> 00:02:11.710
"Buzz! Buzz!" said the bugs.

16
00:02:11.711 --> 00:02:15.389
"I can't sleep here," said Cat.

17
00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:18.896
"The bugs are buzzing."

18
00:02:18.897 --> 00:02:25.281
Cat went to the woods.

19
00:02:25.282 --> 00:02:30.328
The woods were quiet.

20
00:02:30.329 --> 00:02:36.283
Farmer was sleeping in the hammock.

21
00:02:36.284 --> 00:02:49.890
"I can sleep here!" said Cat.

